lity, 99.2% operational reliability\n\n**### Lifecycle Cost Savings & Financial Justification**\n\n* Exact lifecycle savings of the winning vendor (Vendor B - Grundfos) compared to each competitor:\n\t+ Vs Vendor A - Kirloskar: Rs. 909,000\n\t+ Vs Vendor C - WPIL: Rs. 1,309,000\n* Quantifying how operational energy and AMC savings offset the initial capital expenditure:\n\t+ Operational Energy Savings (10-year): Rs. 541,119\n\t+ Post-Warranty AMC Savings (10-year): Rs. 600,000\n\t+ Total Lifecycle Savings: Rs. 1,141,119\n\nThe superior choice of Vendor B - Grundfos offers significant long-term savings in operational energy costs and post-warranty AMC expenses, justifying the higher initial Capex.",
